La silla de ruedas activa plegable Luna 45,7 cm de Konfort Plus está fabricada en aluminio con tijera de acero y pintura electrostática, y está diseñada para usuarios activos que buscan independencia y control. Sus llantas traseras neumáticas de 24" con desmonte rápido, apoyabrazos abatibles de altura ajustable, reposapiés removibles y ruedas antivuelco la hacen compacta, segura y de alto desempeño. Soporta 130 kg y tiene 3 años de garantía.$d$,
  descripcion_larga_en = $d$The Luna Lite Active Folding Wheelchair is designed for people seeking a lightweight, functional and adaptable solution for daily use. Its aluminum structure offers a balance between strength and lightness, favoring more agile and controlled mobility. It features a foldable frame that facilitates transport and storage, along with quick-release rear wheels, allowing easy volume reduction. Its 8" front wheel facilitates travel on uneven surfaces, passing obstacles with greater smoothness and stability. Its adjustable tension backrest and contoured cushion support posture and adapt to the needs of the body in motion, providing greater comfort during travel.

The Konfort Plus Luna 45.7 cm folding active wheelchair is made of aluminium with a steel cross-brace and electrostatic paint, and is designed for active users seeking independence and control. Its 24" quick-release pneumatic rear tyres, height-adjustable folding armrests, removable footrests and anti-tip wheels make it compact, safe and high-performing. It supports 130 kg and has a 3-year warranty.$d$,
